{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103133","id":2350144086,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6MFFpW","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103133","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103133.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103133.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103133","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103133/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103133/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103133/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fb1baea19d2d4e7089e332dee7b5ae9707cd0728","number":103133,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Lightmapper: Compress albedo and emission atlases with Betsy if available","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"An attempt to decrease the VRAM usage during the lightmap baking process by utilizing Betsy.\r\n\r\nDue to how the lightmapper works, albedo and emissive data from affected objects has to be rendered into atlases with the same resolution as the resulting baked lightmaps, using UV2 coordinates. These textures often contain huge black/transparent chunks due to none of the meshes overlapping said segments, meaning a lot of VRAM is effectively wasted on data that is never used.\r\n\r\nFor instance, a 4096x4096x4 lightmap needs 4x4096 RGBA8 and 4x4096 RGBAH atlases for baking. That amounts to 256mb of albedo and 512mb of emission, so 768mb in total.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes it so the aforementioned atlases are compressed in memory by default, then sent to the GPU, which results in a significantly reduced memory footprint:\r\n\r\nExpected VRAM savings:\r\n- Albedo: 25% of the original VRAM (RGBA8 -> BC3),\r\n- Emission: 12,5% of the original VRAM (RGBAH -> BC6U).\r\n\r\nWith the previous example, the VRAM taken is 64mb for both albedo and emission, so 128mb in total.\r\n\r\nCurrently, the albedo atlases are compressed into BC3 and emission into either BC6U or BC6S.\r\n\r\nThis technique also improves baking times due to the lower bandwidth usage, and it has no noticeable visual downgrades.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archiv